   $q$Aaliyah rides a carousel horse whose height above the platform is $y = 0.4\sin\left(\frac{\pi t}{2}\right) + 1.2$ meters after $t$ seconds. During the first cycle, $0 \le t \le 4$, for how many seconds is the horse higher than $1.4$ meters?$q$, $q$[{"text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$ second","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"gave-first-crossing-time"},{"text":"$2$ seconds","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"used-half-the-period"},{"text":"$\\frac{4}{3}$ seconds","is_correct":true},{"text":"$\\frac{5}{3}$ seconds","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"gave-second-crossing-time"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$$\frac{4}{3}$ seconds$q$, $q$Height above $1.4$ needs $\sin\left(\frac{\pi t}{2}\right) > \frac{1}{2}$, so $\frac{\pi}{6} < \frac{\pi t}{2} < \frac{5\pi}{6}$, which is $\frac{1}{3} < t < \frac{5}{3}$, a span of $\frac{4}{3}$ seconds. The choice $2$ seconds counts the whole time above the midline $1.2$ instead of above $1.4$.$q$, 'draft', null)
